#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:6
#: effa1a5627054042b6fe2c709c5818fc fcc62ad691cb4a90b6725fb978bdb9de
msgid "Moving Platform Takeoff and Landing (Ships, Trucks, etc.)"
msgstr "移动平台起降（舰船、卡车等）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:8
#: 6952e014208c41f5ac68e404f8db2124 bb26c809042b4630b2170071a5e545c3
msgid ""
"The Plane 4.2 firmware supports VTOL taking off and landing on a moving "
"platform with QuadPlanes. VTOL Takeoffs and Landings will track the "
"platform's motion to remain vertically above the takeoff/landing pad and "
"landings will provide a tracking hold-off loitering point and controlled "
"angular approach to avoid vehicle superstructures or other obstructions. "
"This article describes how to setup and use this functionality."
msgstr ""
"Plane 4.2 固件支持 QuadPlane 在移动平台上进行 VTOL 起降。VTOL "
"起降将跟踪平台运动以保持在起降平台正上方，降落时将提供跟踪保持等待盘旋点，并以受控角度进场以避开舰船上层建筑或其他障碍物。本文介绍如何配置和使用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:11
#: 80c04f0d6c2d4f54ae4dab9ab5c78b84 8b4c3931c2594f80a7ac8dddbcfb90ad
msgid "Equipment Needed"
msgstr "所需设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:13
#: dcc40b267c12417dba2d755ac545ab92 e53ae763c8ae4b229f4bbddb650bc166
msgid ""
"To use this feature you need a beacon setup on the landing platform. This "
"beacon should be based on an ArduPilot autopilot running the ArduPilot Rover"
" firmware. You can set the ``FRAME_CLASS`` parameter on the beacon autopilot"
" to \"2\" to make it a “boat” or \"1\" to make it a truck, so that the right"
" icon shows in the ground station. The beacon will be broadcasting its "
"position to allow the QuadPlane to track its moving HOME position, similar "
"to :ref:`Copter's Follow Mode<copter:follow-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"要使用此功能，需要在降落平台上配置一个信标。该信标应基于运行 ArduPilot Rover 固件的 ArduPilot 飞控。可将信标飞控的 "
"``FRAME_CLASS`` 参数设为 「2」（船只）或 「1」（卡车），以在地面站显示对应图标。信标将广播其位置，使 QuadPlane "
"能够跟踪其移动的 Home 位置，类似于 :ref:`Copter 的跟随模式<copter:follow-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:17
#: 5c51acee35464b46aff4a136d0957f0e 93182f033d4e4c3f8f4bd7f0a72e7ecb
