msgid ""
"a reliable yaw source. Using dual-F9P GPS with :ref:`moving baseline "
"yaw<common-gps-for-yaw>` is recommended if the moving platform will cause "
"problems with compasses."
msgstr ""
"可靠的偏航源。若移动平台会对罗盘造成干扰，推荐使用双 F9P GPS 配合 :ref:`移动基线偏航<common-gps-for-yaw>`。"

