"When the aircraft can see the beacon position it will print a GCS message "
"like this: “Have beacon”."
msgstr "当飞机能够接收到信标位置时，将向地面站发送消息，如：「Have beacon」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:95
