msgid ""
"You will also get an arming failure if you try to arm without the beacon "
"working."
msgstr "若在信标未正常工作的情况下尝试解锁，也会收到解锁失败提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:101
#: 84a939e91a6649ec8dded20abde71954 b2f682d3d4fb4ac8a0508289646e1e6d
msgid "Landing Offset"
msgstr "降落偏移量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:102
#: 38402a41b5534154a30c155ca837e17b e3448f66feed48d7a7180daeee84e9ab
msgid ""
"It is important to set the correct values for :ref:`FOLL_OFS_X<FOLL_OFS_X>`,"
" :ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y<FOLL_OFS_Y>` and :ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z<FOLL_OFS_Z>` on the "
"aircraft for the landing point relative to the beacon. These values are in "
"meters, in front-right-down format. The easiest way to set these is to place"
" the aircraft in the correct landing location with the beacon working and "
"then set the parameter ``SHIP_AUTO_OFS`` to 1. When this parameter is set to"
" 1 then the ship landing lua script will calculate the right offset values "
"and set them in the :ref:`FOLL_OFS_X<FOLL_OFS_X>`, "
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y<FOLL_OFS_Y>` and :ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z<FOLL_OFS_Z>` values."
msgstr ""
"在飞机上正确设置 :ref:`FOLL_OFS_X<FOLL_OFS_X>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y<FOLL_OFS_Y>` 和 "
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z<FOLL_OFS_Z>` 的值非常重要，这些值表示降落点相对于信标的偏移量，单位为米，格式为前-"
"右-下。设置这些值最简单的方法是：在信标正常工作时将飞机放置在正确的降落位置，然后将参数 ``SHIP_AUTO_OFS`` 设为 1。当该参数设为 1"
" 时，舰船降落 LUA 脚本将计算正确的偏移值并将其写入 "
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X<FOLL_OFS_X>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y<FOLL_OFS_Y>` 和 "
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z<FOLL_OFS_Z>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:105
#: 02c5c5bdab744b438c127834bea5d30c 6864885f4d424892826c92f352b13c98
msgid "The values are:"
msgstr "各值含义如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:107
#: 790c3b70235542e6a5f924e5d5bc1ba7 fc99a92208b34a10b943d482ed0250ce
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X<FOLL_OFS_X>` distance in front of the beacon to land (use a"
" negative value for landing behind the beacon)"
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X<FOLL_OFS_X>` 在信标前方的降落距离（若在信标后方降落则使用负值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:108
#: 3d1b73400d104050975e01cec0ecdb92 b1a899a192ae426bac117d99dece727d
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y<FOLL_OFS_Y>` distance to the right of the beacon to land "
"(use a negative value for left)"
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y<FOLL_OFS_Y>` 在信标右侧的降落距离（若在左侧则使用负值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:109
#: 399b3b2a885346db88b81d05b74aa225 9d90bbb487be4d54b7d6c84b0fa425a6
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z<FOLL_OFS_Z>` distance below the beacon to land (use a "
"negative value to land above the beacon)"
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z<FOLL_OFS_Z>` 在信标下方的降落距离（若在信标上方降落则使用负值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:111
#: 536fc81899184b209c2dd0ff1711ea0a 871dc0efb75f4e0592af533c73d690be
msgid ""
"When the beacon is active you should see the HOME icon on the GCS move to "
"match the landing position. The HOME position is continuously updated while "
"you are flying which gives you a good way to ensure that the beacon is "
"working properly before you land."
msgstr ""
"信标激活后，地面站上的 Home 图标应移动到与降落位置匹配的位置。Home 位置在飞行过程中持续更新，是在降落前确认信标正常工作的好方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:113
#: 5e58c91d4e9a4a4fa321718773d9a0b8 7fc6d9d9cc0244b7808b9a8e3ddc5748
msgid ""
"It is recommended that the method of setting ``SHIP_AUTO_OFS`` = 1 is used "
"to get the location before each flight. Look carefully at the message it "
"gives when this parameter is set(use the Messages tab in MissionPlanner):"
msgstr ""
"建议在每次飞行前使用 ``SHIP_AUTO_OFS`` = 1 的方法获取位置。设置此参数时请仔细查看给出的消息（使用 Mission Planner"
" 中的消息标签页）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:115
#: 6879fe39d06f4aa1978e82fc6565220c b1df8a510fc54d71b62f83135b487c1e
msgid "Set follow offset (-10.82,3.29,0.46)"
msgstr "Set follow offset (-10.82,3.29,0.46)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:117
#: 1c95e8b59b1b4b4a934bf813d7606e6a 9c128fec2559481796206d0677add9ae
msgid ""
"That message confirms that the X, Y and Z offset has calculated. Check that "
"they are reasonable, paying close attention to the Z offset. If you get a "
"bad Z offset (ie. a long way off from the actual height difference between "
"the beacon and the aircraft) then you may need to reboot the beacon and/or "
"aircraft to cope with GPS altitude drift."
msgstr ""
"该消息确认已计算出 X、Y 和 Z 偏移量。请检查这些值是否合理，尤其要注意 Z 偏移量。如果 Z "
"偏移量异常（即与信标和飞机之间的实际高度差相差悬殊），则可能需要重启信标和/或飞机以应对 GPS 高度漂移问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:120
#: 010ab4c469844b20b400c039fca6e675 37ecd52c18da4c1eaa2fdaf5d51b9d9c
msgid "Takeoff Procedure"
msgstr "起飞程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:121
#: 742a247fe43242f0907ecab8a6d6a68d c5227dcde08c4acba52d114ff539267c
msgid ""
"When ``SHIP_ENABLE`` = 1 and the beacon is visible to the aircraft then an "
"AUTO VTOL takeoff will use velocity matching, so the aircraft will hold its "
"velocity relative to the beacon while ascending. This velocity matching is "
"only done for VTOL takeoff as a mission item in AUTO mode."
msgstr ""
"当 ``SHIP_ENABLE`` = 1 且飞机可见信标时，AUTO 模式下的 VTOL "
"自动起飞将使用速度匹配，即飞机在上升过程中将保持相对于信标的速度。速度匹配仅在 AUTO 模式任务项中的 VTOL 起飞时执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:124
#: 36c26f7bda70434faf75fef29fd3af06 49f1017eb76f4f719eeb2be0a8f47dae
msgid "Hold-off Position"
msgstr "保持等待位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:125
#: 0167455676e14346a31a1b999fb00c46 d908b7a4095f49fda9a4f2e6bf6be9df
msgid ""
"A key part of ship landing is the “hold-off position”. The hold-off position"
" is where the aircraft will loiter while waiting for the pilot to command "
"the landing via the movement of the throttle stick (see throttle stick "
"information below)."
msgstr "舰船降落的关键部分是「保持等待位置」。保持等待位置是飞机在等待飞手通过油门杆（详见下方油门杆说明）发出降落指令时盘旋等待的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:127
#: 88690b131fef4a61997efed05559d278 cc855835da604e9cbd996065668d57f6
msgid "The holdoff position is based on a few criteria:"
msgstr "保持等待位置基于以下几个条件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:129
#: 5e611019c6f647888aaa1e5409f523fc 8c878aea197245efb5f8da5368aea521
msgid ""
":ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` in meters (negative for counter-clockwise "
"loiter, positive for clockwise loiter). If :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` is "
"zero, then the :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` parameter is used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>`，单位为米（负值为逆时针盘旋，正值为顺时针盘旋）。若 "
":ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` 为零，则使用 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:130
#: 6269f0fd003f4a0f93cb6f14deb84c0a 6b8bf9b12db7480cac1bf08c3728de04
msgid ""
"``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` parameter, which controls the angle that the aircraft "
"will approach the ship for landing. A value of zero means to approach from "
"behind the ship. The hold-off loiter position will be setup so that the "
"tangent of the circle intercepts the beacon landing point."
msgstr ""
"``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` 参数，控制飞机对舰船的进场角度。值为零表示从舰船后方进场。保持等待盘旋位置将设置为使圆的切线与信标降落点相交。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:131
#: c088c1b71e1445f9be0c20b76fe0810d db1594a66837425385d4653323e782b3
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` parameter, which determines how fast the"
" aircraft can slow down"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` 参数，决定飞机可以减速的速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:132
#: 0c05c7e42bbe4a88b5a91c7bff3b9bc6 2135951032414f37b9d9f79a4a2770f2
msgid "The speed of the ship, the wind speed and the speed of the aircraft"
msgstr "舰船速度、风速和飞机速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:134
#: 112e531bd53f4fd7aace25de29a82bc6 63eebef8bed742c4ab522de495234ea2
msgid ""
"Here is an example where ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` is -45 and "
":ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` is -100:"
msgstr ""
"以下是 ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` = -45 且 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` = -100 的示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:138
#: 2f3b9bf67f47431c9abe8ac74071b417 780453bbcc5d4404b5a2258673569f03
msgid ""
"and here is an example with ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` at 0 and "
":ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` at 100:"
msgstr ""
"以下是 ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` = 0 且 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS<RTL_RADIUS>` = 100 的示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:143
#: 0335e2684dc540caaa9a0fa7c2ae6aa3 94c7f885d4d649eda2c10b64ed7a3450
msgid "Landing Procedure"
msgstr "降落程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:144
#: 417c29596d1b402ab5de1e84802ac8b3 b621a4e373c847a0aade74c3fc0c0acd
msgid ""
"When you are ready to land you can switch the vehicle to RTL mode. When in "
"RTL mode the aircraft will fly towards the landing location (you can see "
"this location before you land from the HOME icon on the GCS, which moves "
"with the beacon)."
msgstr ""
"准备降落时，可将飞机切换至 RTL 模式。在 RTL 模式下，飞机将朝向降落位置飞行（降落前可从地面站的 Home 图标看到该位置，随信标移动）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:146
#: b31b1e310b5844e9a233b1658318ff74 f55dfca6c4ef4be2871225ed2275d981
msgid ""
"The aircraft will initially approach the “hold-off” position. The altitude "
"of the holdoff position is set by the :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` "
"parameter (in centimeters above the landing location). A good value of this "
"is around 9000, which is 90 meters above the landing location."
msgstr ""
"飞机最初将飞向「保持等待」位置。保持等待位置的高度由 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` "
"参数设定（单位为厘米，相对于降落位置上方）。建议设为约 9000，即降落位置上方 90 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:148
#: d765108daca74a4884a1360a2b8b9554 e5dc341ce67a479bacfc2c4eddaf6801
msgid ""
"The description below will assume that ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` = 0 which means "
"landing happens from behind the beacon. The approach and landing is rotated "
"by the value of this parameter in degrees. With ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` = 0, the"
" hold-off position will be behind and above the beacon. The distance depends"
" on the beacon speed, wind speed and the :ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>`"
" parameter (which controls the deceleration of the aircraft)."
msgstr ""
"以下说明假设 ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` = 0，即从信标后方降落。进场和降落角度随该参数值（度数）旋转。当 "
"``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` = 0 时，保持等待位置将在信标后方上方。距离取决于信标速度、风速以及 "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_DECEL<Q_TRANS_DECEL>` 参数（控制飞机减速率）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:151
#: b295d632ed524db9a16ebbc51a71ab7e b3908d6528a3419989892b558d82c7b6
msgid ""
"Once the aircraft arrives at the hold-off position it will circle until the "
"throttle stick is lowered below 40%. The throttle stick on the transmitter "
"is used to control the landing sequence and also to abort the landing."
msgstr "飞机到达保持等待位置后将持续盘旋，直到油门杆降至 40% 以下。遥控器上的油门杆用于控制降落序列，也可用于中止降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:153
#: 059616f5d9334430931e44cc38c45e68 a6ae7ec6d1844644a9ee8961ad4364ab
msgid "Throttle stick controls are:"
msgstr "油门杆控制如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:155
#: 0e452737858e4e75b0508223599255bb 4562af8cce4c42e2bc3f3fbf0e7255ea
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Throttle at 40% or above means to hold at the hold-off position (at "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` height above beacon in centimeters)"
msgstr "油门杆在 40% 或以上：保持在等待位置（位于信标上方 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 厘米高度处）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:156
#: 1610a91a5f81418f841fe1ab947c9e28 b0fca4b26722487b89c97d98fdcf61fc
msgid ""
"Throttle below 40% and above 10% means to descend while loitering to the "
"approach altitude. The approach altitude is giving by "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` in meters above the beacon. A good value for "
"testing may be 40 meters."
msgstr ""
"油门杆低于 40% 且高于 10%：在盘旋中下降至进场高度。进场高度由 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` "
"给定（单位为米，相对于信标上方）。测试时建议设为 40 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:157
#: c4b3922d2c87477d8ea5cc6eb83528df d908d230841b433ab40f41ccdf920e41
msgid ""
"Throttle below 10% means to start landing approach once the aircraft is at "
"the :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` and lined up with the ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` to"
" move toward the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"油门杆低于 10%：当飞机在 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` 高度且与 ``SHIP_LAND_ANGLE`` "
"方向对齐后，开始向飞机移动的降落进场。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:159
#: 213f831706e8456da72e932906b551a9 8fdfdafd66394f74890a9bed6c6acf76
msgid ""
"Once the landing descent has started can still abort the landing. To do "
"this, the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 15 must be set to enable "
"ThrLandControl. When that option is set you can raise the throttle "
"momentarily above 70% to enable throttle control for climb and descent rate."
" You can use this to slow the descent or climb back up. If you climb up past"
" the :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` approach altitude then the aircraft will go"
" back to loitering at the hold-off location at :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`."
msgstr ""
"降落下降开始后仍可中止降落。为此，:ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 15 位必须置 1 以启用 "
"ThrLandControl。设置该选项后，可将油门瞬间提高至 70% 以上来启用油门控制下降和爬升速率。可用此功能减慢下降速度或重新爬升。若爬升超过 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` 进场高度，飞机将返回在保持等待位置以 :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` "
"高度盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:161
#: 9cdad89e593e44599c892650b3e7da61 b2df1c9767e14688b67567a226fc280d
msgid ""
"You may also want to enable horizontal repositioning with the "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 17(EnableLandResponsition). If that is "
"enabled then you can manually reposition the aircraft horizontally while "
"landing to account for any GPS position errors."
msgstr ""
"还可以通过 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 17 "
"位（EnableLandResponsition）启用水平重新定位。启用后，可在降落过程中手动水平移动飞机以应对 GPS 位置误差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:164
#: 122be5e369114e57b439e66975e70f70 69fa91a6690d45a5a25cad25c1943148
msgid "Simple Mission"
msgstr "简单任务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:165
#: 1b37c8d1a25e4a7391fddd98b33f8865 1f151c20b12b4cfd87f30438e64f1c71
msgid ""
"The simplest mission would be a single VTOL_TAKEOFF waypoint. Once the "
"takeoff is complete the aircraft will immediately switch to RTL mode and go "
"to the hold-off location. You should have the throttle stick above 40% to "
"keep the aircraft circling at the hold-off location. This very simple "
"mission is good for ship operations as it does not have specific "
"latitude/longitude, so will work wherever the ship is."
msgstr ""
"最简单的任务是单个 VTOL_TAKEOFF 航点。起飞完成后，飞机将立即切换至 RTL 模式并前往保持等待位置。应将油门杆保持在 40% "
"以上，使飞机持续在保持等待位置盘旋。这个非常简单的任务非常适合舰船作业，因为它不包含特定的经纬度坐标，无论舰船在何处都能使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:167
#: 1283f296aa1144b9901a09d68c558cd1 8679be29de94489da6b2e7f1a482f7ae
msgid ""
"You could also switch to a fixed wing mode just before reaching the takeoff "
"altitude you set, then fly under pilot control and when ready to land, "
"simply switch back into AUTO to RTL and land."
msgstr "也可以在达到设定的起飞高度之前切换至固定翼模式，在飞手控制下飞行，准备降落时直接切换回 AUTO 模式执行 RTL 并降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:170
#: a598b08ab25141cc99efe549d0aa4b91 ea9b8cc2472945e288ce7b70e9137c15
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:172
#: 8bc382e679694958a9f9fd97dd509080 f564a37eb5c34eb99fe66a7155b52675
msgid "To simulate a QuadPlane ship landing:"
msgstr "仿真 QuadPlane 舰船降落："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:174
#: 9f2ef1395b9a4bd4aafaa556fded3b06 e0ec70b45b3341cbb4a7af4e2395b3fe
msgid ""
"Copy the plane_ship_landing.lua LUA script, into the /scripts directory "
"where you will run the simulation"
msgstr "将 plane_ship_landing.lua LUA 脚本复制到将要运行仿真的 /scripts 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:175
#: 35b6f91f9007476cb434f67df4edef35 4144aabeeb444cf7a2c1573e9cd7cf1f
msgid "Run the following commands for Linux SITL:"
msgstr "在 Linux SITL 中运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:187
#: 956616375e744a3facbdefb62054f00f e0e51f9d22d14f9dadb6371053bfaebd
msgid "Then setup a mission item: VTOL_TAKEOFF to the desired altitude"
msgstr "然后设置任务项：VTOL_TAKEOFF 到所需高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:188
#: 9e884ee517e04904bbc7057f6bc10ae4 df7cb14aa9894b1fad344b3be9c750d0
msgid "Enter:"
msgstr "输入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:196
#: c5878151fb8a4dc28648f437c2535458 e3284397dbcc4108a579d1dbb129b0c5
msgid ""
"The QuadPlane will takeoff and then execute an RTL to the hold-off point and"
" wait until the throttle is lowered (rc 3 1000) to start the landing."
msgstr "QuadPlane 将起飞，然后执行 RTL 飞向保持等待点，等待油门降低（rc 3 1000）后开始降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:199
#: ea72bfceb5df4c1282291e59c64bddea f852ea64800f45678e353a278fed2f57
msgid "Credit:"
msgstr "致谢："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:201
#: 4a123cf6edf047a183448578b2604384 63e1aa0150f94a9c8394a631d19718f2
msgid ""
"Many thanks to SpektreWorks for funding a lot of the work on ship landing "
"support!"
msgstr "衷心感谢 SpektreWorks 为舰船降落支持功能提供的大量资金支持！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ship-landing.rst:41
#: 1e22f71c0fa04ad0880957fff058d62e
msgid ""
"using any kind of telemetry for GCS <-> vehicle and GCS <-> beacon, setup "
"the GCS to forward GLOBAL_POSITION_INT packets from the beacon to the "
"aircraft (for example, MAVProxy GCS can do this by setting the fwdpos to "
"TRUE (ie type 'set fwdpos true' from the command line)"
msgstr ""
"使用任意类型的数传实现地面站 <-> 载具和地面站 <-> 信标的通信时，将地面站设置为把信标的 GLOBAL_POSITION_INT "
"数据包转发给飞机（例如，MAVProxy 地面站可通过将 fwdpos 设为 TRUE 来实现，即在命令行输入 'set fwdpos true'）"
